      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“That dress,” he breathes",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 424
        },
        {
          "text": "Jess gave me the blue dress and the boots I’m wearing for my twenty-fifth birthday",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 449
        },
        {
          "text": "“Not good?” I ask",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 686
        },
        {
          "text": "“The opposite.” He moves closer, wrapping an arm around me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 703
        },
        {
          "text": "“Do I look ready to impress your bosses?” I ask, deflecting the compliment",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 883
        },
        {
          "text": "“I wish there were another way.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1081
        }
      ],
      "words": 57
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "And then the sickly-sweet antiseptic smell of the Agency fills my nose",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1846
        },
        {
          "text": "I’m still in the same clothes I was in back in my apartment. I still have ten fingers",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1982
        },
        {
          "text": "My cell phone, and the physical photos I need for this plan, are right where they should be",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2149
        },
        {
          "text": "All good signs",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2242
        }
      ],
      "words": 54
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "More than a dozen formless human-size shapes wearing suits just like Daniel’s sit at cafeteria-style tables, holding cof",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2913
        },
        {
          "text": "“Reapers.” Daniel’s voice is grim. “Yes.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3839
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eternity’s a long time.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4182
        },
        {
          "text": "He ticks the items off on his fingers. “None of their workplace perks actually help.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4425
        }
      ],
      "words": 50
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Seems like Monday comes earlier every week.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5690
        },
        {
          "text": "Another Reaper says something as it passes by our closet. It sounds like “Fucking Mondays.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6006
        },
        {
          "text": "People dying is just a clock-in, clock-out job to them. It was to Daniel, too—before he met me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6382
        },
        {
          "text": "“I’m glad that when you look at me, you see a man.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7073
        },
        {
          "text": "“I’d still like you even if I saw you as you really are.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7172
        }
      ],
      "words": 69
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He crushes me to him. “Please let me send you home so I can do this for you.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9734
